{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galactic Coffee Shop is a sci fi incremental game where you build a coffee enterprise from a humble coffee stand to a star stretching empire. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your coffee creation capacities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Produce unrealized amounts of coffee</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach new markets to sell more and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the very means of coffee production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand into space and beyond</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692320/extras/ratcoffee.gif?t=1746059319\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you grow through the stages of coffee production, your role at the head of a coffee empire changes, and you reach higher levels of management. Move on from personally making the coffee to accumulating employees. Go from managing a single store to a thriving franchise. At each new stage of coffee domination comes more means to expand even further!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692320?t=1746059319","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692320?t=1746059319","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692320/1f5729aa8bcaaf49a0f0e8b053d2a2db76e068f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746059319","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692320/1f5729aa8bcaaf49a0f0e8b053d2a2db76e068f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746059319","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galactic Coffee Shop is a sci fi incremental game where you build a coffee enterprise from a h